  "details": "Hello, I would like to suggest a feature that could be integrated on the website, either it's own tab or integrated into the user moderations tab (Blocks & Mutes).\n\nThis is useful for being able to know who has yet to accept your friends request, and the ability to easily revoke it at any time. This can be especially useful if maybe someone is deciding to accept it, and takes a break from VRChat as a whole. Which I recently experienced a few times. It can get frustrating when after a month the person accepts it, and you no longer have any connection. It would be nice to see if people were interested, if not then you can get rid of the invitation.",
